# Waltz of Rage: your Runeclaw Bear (the source, power 2) deals 2 to each other creature, whoever controls it (CR 120.3): your Memnite, Bot2's Ornithopter and Elvish Mystic
# die, the Bear lives. The delayed ability made as the spell resolves (CR 603.7b) sees your Memnite die and exiles the top card of your library, Lightning Bolt, but not
# Bot2's creatures. It lasts only this turn: Bot2's Bolt on the Bear on turn 4 exiles nothing. The Bolt can still be cast on turn 5, "until the end of your next turn".

